{"ID":"20230927165102-g264suz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927165102-g264suz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165102-g264suz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165105-0hr4h82\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165105-q5h88qe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165105-q5h88qe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:19,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:19\u0026#125;","title":"大戟","type":"doc","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927165105-0hr4h82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-0hr4h82","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大戟，逐水药，猛药。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-mzabtql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-mzabtql","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘遂、大戟、芫花，十枣汤逐水三剑客；"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-xkp7nmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-xkp7nmi","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大戟药性，类似于在你身体有痰水的地方戳一个洞，把水放掉；"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-mfswk20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-mfswk20","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大戟所使用的部位，是植物比较靠皮的部分，那甘遂比较用的是根啊，所以有人会说，大戟它的作用点可能比甘遂更容易靠向人的表面。神农本草经里记载大戟写说正常了吗皮肤疼痛，所以就可能比较作用在靠表面部分（当然也不绝对正确，因为大戟也可以治疗面目浮肿）。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-bdou49g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-bdou49g","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大戟在祛水时同时有一点点发汗。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-1j9jbiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-1j9jbiz","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在中国历史上，大戟比较是根大枣是好朋友。就是历史上有些常用的这些，处理这个水肿比较重要的方子，比如说用大戟跟这个红枣煮一起，然后把大戟丢掉，把大枣烘干做药丸。就是用红枣来吸纳大戟祛水的力道，然后吃那个红枣丸，然后它就变得比较不伤身。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165105-q5h88qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165105-q5h88qe","updated":"20230927165105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如中了大戟的毒的话就用菖蒲来解这个毒。"}]}]}